mre2b@virginia.edu (mre) writes:

>In article <3mtu1s$r69@ixnews4.ix.netcom.com>,
>   astarita@ix.netcom.com (Mark Astarita) wrote:
>>That extension alone is a problem, given the difference in the mediums, 
